<p class="lead">Most compound bows fit one archer. The Bear Legit Maxx RTH is designed to fit several versions of the same archer over the years. With a 14" to 30" draw length range and a 10 to 70 lb draw weight range, the Bear Legit Maxx RTH can start as a light practice bow for a young shooter and end up as a legitimate adult hunting bow, all without buying a new frame.</p>

<p>That makes it one of the most popular answers to the question &ldquo;what is a good youth compound bow that grows?&rdquo; This review covers the verified Legit Maxx specs, what ships in the RTH package, and, most importantly, how to step up draw weight safely so a new archer builds good form instead of bad habits.</p>

<h2 id="h-bear-legit-maxx-rth-specs">Bear Legit Maxx RTH Specs</h2>
